Subject: [PATCH 37/41] tracker 0.9.1: deliberate resets (button, power-on,
 USB-serial reset, debugger) do not count as a reset loop: boot_resets from
 the SoC reset cause (lt_reset_deliberate, lt_boot_resets_next), so a reboot
 by the owner always opens the Bluetooth window and reports after 30 s; txcap
 last_reset

---
 zephcore/src/lt_version.h     |  2 +-
 zephcore/src/main_tracker.cpp | 76 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

